{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>意籍甜點師主理!意式忌廉包/牛角包</p><p>灣仔新開Gelato雪糕甜品店！</p><p>曾於米芝蓮星級餐廳主理甜點，意籍甜點師 Fabio Bardi 於灣仔開全新甜點概念店 Sugar Daddy。靈感源自意大利著名的咖啡廳文化，主打每天新鮮供應自家製意式手工雪糕、即烘意式忌廉包、意式牛角包、精緻意式甜點，以及香醇的意式濃縮咖啡。</p><p>多款自家製Gelato口味</p><p>店內所有甜點及雪糕均為每日新鮮製造，嚴選頂級天然食材，精心搭配低糖低脂配方。自家製Gelato招牌口味包括花生日本黑芝麻、薑汁牛奶、 Valrhona 朱古力、西西里柑橘等，亦會隨季節呈獻限定 Gelato 及清新雪葩，每次到訪都充滿驚喜。</p><p>必食招牌意式忌廉包 Maritozzo</p><p>另一款招牌是意式忌廉包 Maritozzo，以鬆軟微甜的 brioche 麵包為基底，夾入輕盈如雲朵般的鮮忌廉，層次豐富的口感。店內亦供應自家製的意式牛角包 Cornetti，外酥內軟，可自選雲呢嗱忌廉或自榛子朱古力醬等豐富餡料。</p><p>Sugar Daddy 地址：灣仔皇后大道東104號富通大廈地下 電話： 6876 5284 (WhatsApp) 營業時間：星期二至五：上午 8:00 至 下午 6:30， 星期六、日及公眾假期：上午 9:30 至 下午 7:30，（星期一休息） 官方IG：@cafesugardaddyhk</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179109363935369722_17875248386ac1eb87ad631.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179109364133681803_19576600326ac1eb89bfc46.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179109364337340458_2569015776ac1eb8c17427.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17910936466418030_3957798176ac1eb8ef0a11.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17910936484279288_13146240586ac1eb91afc0a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179109365143052334_11718441366ac1eb940958e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17910936532146248_1014484266ac1eb971eb83.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179109365810414873_18794575046ac1eb9a7d38b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179109365973968233_12555368006ac1eb9c23e90.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04T06:18:10.958404+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":654,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}